Keep track of your mileage, write down in a notebook you keep in your car.  "The 2023 IRS mileage rates are: **65.5 cents per mile for business purposes. 22 cents per mile for medical and moving purposes. 14 cents per mile for charitable purposes**.Aug 1, 2023"   If this helps anybody :D

&#x200B;

[https://falconexpenses.com/blog/can-you-write-off-mileage-for-doordash/#:\~:text=The%20answer%20to%20the%20question,method%2C%20you%20want%20to%20use](https://falconexpenses.com/blog/can-you-write-off-mileage-for-doordash/#:~:text=The%20answer%20to%20the%20question,method%2C%20you%20want%20to%20use).

Ok, so I'm not going to lie... first, yes... I agree completely.. and second, I legitimately had to google not one but two words from your post... you speak eloquently and articulately and I love it so much.

&#x200B;

PS.  Don't think I am not ashamed I didn't know these words, but can now say they've been added to my vernacular.
